text:
For the first time in 3 decades, there was no need for humanitarian food distributions among 20 communities in Tana River County, #Kenya. The transformation has been thanks to the LEAF Project, a partnership between 
@concernwwus + ADM. 
Learn more: https://t.co/X3bAuAqUus https://t.co/fRfyXbIA8u

Something BIG is happening at our facility in Toledo, OH! 🌻🎨  

@ToledoRiverWall will cover 28 grain silos, using about 5,000 gallons of paint, and is set to be the largest mural in the US. 

Thank you to Urban Sight, @gabe_gault + team! 😍 https://t.co/K3NxhcoQ2E
